WEBVTT

00:05:58.928 --> 00:06:35.738
★John and his friends like to play soccer together, but recently they have not had much time. Last month, they decided to set a time when they could always play together. They agreed on Sunday afternoons, but when the first Sunday came, John had to study for a test, so they moved their game to Sunday morning instead. Now, they play soccer every Sunday morning, no matter what.
☆☆Question: How did John and his friends solve their problem?
